                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This week, I walked to raise awareness for firefighter cancer. Cancer impacts too many lives and I'm fighting to end that.\n\nIt's why I led a resolution to designate a \"National Cancer Prevention Day\" and legislation to allow for Medicare coverage of early cancer detection tests.",
