                "reply_count": 13,
                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "While hospitals and insurance companies rake in record profits, American families are drowning in debt.\n\nMy \"Patients Deserve Price Tags Act\" changes that. \n\nIt\u2019s simple: before you walk into a hospital or doctor\u2019s office, you ought to know what the heck something costs. https://t.co/E7pIpyQSa8",
